From c19dfad980e444a88995b72ca4e0502eb6f9f216 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 21:56:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add analytics dashboard, membership admin, and member portal
 with audio player

- Full analytics page with traffic charts, hourly heatmap, device/browser/country breakdowns, and time range filters
- Enhanced admin dashboard with revenue, orders, views, and member stats
- Client-side analytics tracker with session tracking and UTM support
- Membership admin page showing plans, subscribers, and revenue stats
- Member auth (login/signup) with Supabase auth and member profile creation
- Member library page displaying purchased audio with cover art
- Built-in audio player with play/pause, seek, progress bar, and auto-save playback position
- Streaming API with access control (verifies library ownership before serving signed R2 URLs)
- Member account page showing profile, membership status, and library stats

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
